      "mentions": 99,
      "title": {
        "en": "Compassionate and dedicated clinical team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "An overwhelming number of pet owners praise the Beehive team in Rothwell for their kindness, professionalism, and genuine warmth. Clients frequently mention that receptionists, veterinary nurses, and surgeons make both pets and owners feel supported. While two reviewers reported disappointing service, the vast majority describe an exceptional standard of personal care."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 54,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle and patient pet handling"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers regularly emphasize how gently their dogs, cats, and rabbits are handled during consultations and surgeries. Many clients with anxious or rescue animals appreciate that the vets take time to build trust and keep examinations stress-free. Pet owners frequently remark that their animals genuinely look forward to visiting the practice."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 29,
      "title": {
        "en": "Clear advice and responsive guidance"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently commend the practice for taking time to explain treatment plans, diagnostic options, and aftercare in clear terms. Reviewers note that staff answer questions thoroughly without rushing consultations or pressurising owners into unnecessary procedures. A few owners noted billing misunderstandings, but communication is broadly praised."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Is Beehive Vets an independent practice?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, Beehive Vets operates as an independent small animal veterinary practice in Rothwell."
      },
      "basis": "website"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Does the clinic offer keyhole surgical spays?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, the practice provides laparoscopic keyhole surgery alongside traditional surgical procedures."
      },
      "basis": "website"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Can clients book appointments online?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, pet owners can schedule routine appointments online through the practice booking system."
      },
