    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "How does the clinic handle nervous or anxious pets?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently note that the staff use gentle, fear-free handling techniques to soothe nervous dogs and cats."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
